flowchart LR
    A[Developer Push] --> B[Pre-Commit Hooks]
    B --> C[CI Pipeline Triggered]
    C --> D{Gate 1:<br/>SAST + Secrets}
    D -->|Pass| E{Gate 2:<br/>IaC Policy Check}
    D -->|Fail| F[Block Merge<br/>+ Report Finding]
    E -->|Pass| G{Gate 3:<br/>Privacy Deployment Gate}
    E -->|Fail| F
    G -->|Pass| H[Deploy to Staging]
    G -->|Fail| F
    H --> I[Post-Deploy Validation]
    I --> J[Production Deploy]

    style D fill:#f9d6d6,stroke:#d44
    style E fill:#fef3cd,stroke:#d4a
    style G fill:#d4edda,stroke:#28a745
